# Renders the README GIF. Requires https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Usage: vhs demo/demo.tape   (run from the repo root with skillhub on PATH)
Output demo/skillhub-demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 680
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "skillhub demo"
Enter
Sleep 10s
